{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-85","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-talk-403815841-line","text":"你来到了夫莱昂机械联盟的停泊港湾。这里有一个大埠口，遍布各类机械招待员。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-talk-403815842-line","text":"一位机械招待员带你走上台阶…你发现这台阶是由一条条机械手臂托举而成的。你一直向前，直到离开港湾，看见「星际和平机械分部商城」的招牌。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-talk-403815843-line","text":"这里的装修风格十分有公司派头…你来到了柜台前。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-talk-403815844-line","text":"「我们卖东西，在埠口价格会实惠些。就这样。」机械职员懒得说太多，示意你自己选。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-text-18329540024484485048-choice","text":"升级你的认知。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-text-4811374905876353498-choice","text":"香涎干酪。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-text-3105603394050198235-choice","text":"测不准匣。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-85-text-1985836473614453803-choice","text":"异木果实。","speaker":""}]}
